@startuml goal-planner-service-class-diagram
title Level 3: Code - Class Diagram (goal-planner-service) - FR-05\nOwner: Yomna Mohamed Fekry
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor<<component>> #D5EFE0
  BorderColor<<component>> #2E8B57
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
hide empty members

legend right
  |<#D5EFE0>   | Class of a component |
  |<#FFFFFF>   | Interface / domain class |
  | Solid arrow, open head | Uses (required interface / class) |
  | Dotted arrow, hollow head | Implements (provided interface) |
  | Filled diamond | Composition |
  | Plain line | Association |
endlegend

interface IGoalPlanner <<provided>> {
  +GeneratePlanAsync(request): ServiceResult<PlanDraft>
  +UpdateDraftAsync(draftId, input): ServiceResult<PlanDraft>
  +ApproveAsync(draftId): ServiceResult<PlanDraft>
  +DiscardAsync(draftId): ServiceResult<bool>
  +GetDraftAsync(draftId): Task<PlanDraft?>
  +GetTasksAsync(goalId): List<PlanTask>
}

class GoalPlannerService <<component>> {
  -goalClient: IGoalClient
  -aiProvider: IAIProvider
  -repository: IPlanDraftRepository
  --
  +GeneratePlanAsync(...) / UpdateDraftAsync(...)
  +ApproveAsync(...) / DiscardAsync(...)
  +GetDraftAsync(...) / GetTasksAsync(...)
}

interface IGoalClient <<required - Academic service>> {
  +GoalExistsAsync(goalId): Task<bool>
}

class HttpGoalClient <<component>> {
  -httpClient: HttpClient
  --
  +GoalExistsAsync(goalId)
}

interface IAIProvider <<required - AI provider>> {
  +GenerateAsync(prompt): Task<AiPlan>
}

class MockAIProvider <<component>> {
  --
  +GenerateAsync(prompt)
}

interface IPlanDraftRepository <<required - Database>> {
  +GetByIdAsync(draftId): Task<PlanDraft?>
  +AddAsync(draft): Task
  +Remove(draft): void
  +SaveChangesAsync(): Task
  +GetApprovedTasksByGoalAsync(goalId): Task<List<PlanTask>>
}

class PlanDraftRepository <<component>> {
  -context: GoalPlannerDbContext
  --
  +GetByIdAsync(...) / AddAsync(...)
  +Remove(...) / SaveChangesAsync(...)
  +GetApprovedTasksByGoalAsync(...)
}

class GoalPlannerDbContext {
  +PlanDrafts: DbSet<PlanDraft>
  +Milestones: DbSet<Milestone>
  +PlanTasks: DbSet<PlanTask>
}

class PlanDraft {
  -draftId: String
  -studentId: String
  -goalId: String?
  -goalText: String
  -status: PlanStatus
  --
  +approve(): void
}
class Milestone {
  -milestoneId: String
  -title: String
  -deadline: DateOnly
  -orderIndex: int
}
class PlanTask {
  -taskId: String
  -title: String
  -durationHours: int
  -deadline: DateOnly
  -dependsOnTaskId: String?
}
enum PlanStatus {
  Draft
  Approved
}

IGoalPlanner <|.. GoalPlannerService
GoalPlannerService --> IGoalClient
GoalPlannerService --> IAIProvider
GoalPlannerService --> IPlanDraftRepository
HttpGoalClient ..|> IGoalClient
MockAIProvider ..|> IAIProvider
PlanDraftRepository ..|> IPlanDraftRepository
PlanDraftRepository --> GoalPlannerDbContext
GoalPlannerDbContext --> PlanDraft
PlanDraft *-- "1..*" Milestone
Milestone *-- "1..*" PlanTask
PlanDraft --> PlanStatus
note bottom of GoalPlannerService
SOLID applied:
S - GoalPlannerService orchestrates; adapters and repository each do one job.
O - A new AI model is added by a new IAIProvider implementation; the planner is not changed.
L - GoalPlannerService can replace any other IGoalPlanner implementation.
I - IGoalPlanner exposes only the operations its clients use.
D - GoalPlannerService depends on IGoalClient, IAIProvider, and IPlanDraftRepository.
end note
@enduml
